WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.049
Add another Mac to SpecWithCode with one line.

2
00:00:03.049 --> 00:00:04.780
It takes about two minutes.

3
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:07.749
The new Mac makes a line.

4
00:00:07.749 --> 00:00:11.840
Your main machine accepts it, over your private Tailscale network.

5
00:00:13.267 --> 00:00:18.507
On the new Mac, open SpecWithCode and choose Join my existing machines.

6
00:00:19.933 --> 00:00:23.273
SpecWithCode checks that Tailscale is connected.

7
00:00:23.273 --> 00:00:26.613
Give this Mac a name, then choose Make the line.

8
00:00:28.033 --> 00:00:29.001
Copy the line.

9
00:00:29.001 --> 00:00:30.730
Treat it like a password:

10
00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:32.943
anyone with it can add this Mac.

11
00:00:32.943 --> 00:00:36.953
Once it's pasted on your main machine, choose I pasted it.

12
00:00:38.367 --> 00:00:39.524
This Mac is done.

13
00:00:39.524 --> 00:00:43.607
Leave SpecWithCode running, and finish on your main machine.

14
00:00:45.033 --> 00:00:51.153
On your main machine, open Settings, Connections, and paste the line into Add a machine.

15
00:00:52.567 --> 00:00:57.820
When the Mac appears under Your private machines, choose Allow workers on its card.

16
00:00:57.820 --> 00:01:01.807
If it doesn't connect on its own, choose Connect machine first.

17
00:01:03.233 --> 00:01:05.095
Already set up the new Mac?

18
00:01:05.095 --> 00:01:08.473
Use Invite this machine in Settings, Connections.

19
00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:11.065
No desktop app?

20
00:01:11.065 --> 00:01:12.385
Install from npm.

21
00:01:12.385 --> 00:01:16.422
Run specwithcode service install to keep it running.

22
00:01:16.422 --> 00:01:19.140
Then run specwithcode fleet invite.

23
00:01:20.567 --> 00:01:24.169
Join, make the line, add it, allow workers.

24
00:01:24.169 --> 00:01:25.007
That's it.
